": "only the upper triangle\n(j > i) is scanned", "originalText": "only the upper triangle\n(j > i) is scanned", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "1b622c63afc14c8785439177c079e11c", "type": "text", "x": 760, "y": 336, "width": 476.0, "height": 56.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#707070", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 427655019, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1106242800, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1732492800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Each undirected edge appears twice in the matrix —\n(2,3) lives at [1][2] AND [2][1]. Counting the whole\nmatrix would give 10; the upper triangle gives 5.", "originalText": "Each undirected edge appears twice in the matrix —\n(2,3) lives at [1][2] AND [2][1]. Counting the whole\nmatrix would give 10; the upper triangle gives 5.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "60a9462eb44944d9985fc1de08c9be93", "type": "rectangle", "x": 690.0, "y": 420, "width": 340, "height": 54, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 639565468, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 515146859, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "97c02abf636d45bebd759bb28a9b7d6c", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1732492800000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "97c02abf636d45bebd759bb28a9b7d6c", "type": "text", "x": 690.0, "y": 435.125, "width": 340, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 154632257, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1257933672, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1732492800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Total number of edges = 5", "originalText": "Total number of edges = 5", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "60a9462eb44944d9985fc1de08c9be93", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "3eebf3d7de754b57b2bb4f3fbee934ec", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 1045.0, "width": 822.8, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#707070", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 768457384, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1193667167, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1732492800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Full write-up: Explanations/12_count_graph_edges.md   •   Code: Problems/12_count_graph_edges.cpp", "originalText": "Full write-up: Explanations/12_count_graph_edges.md   •   Code: Problems/12_count_graph_edges.cpp", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}